ngle MCN.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1996\">1996</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_MO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: 1996\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1997\">1997</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_MO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: 1997\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 BMO (page does not exist)\">1997 BMO</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_BMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 BMO Problems (page does not exist)\">1997 BMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_BMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 BMO Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_BMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 BMO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_BMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 BMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_BMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 BMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1998\">1998</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_MO_Problems_and_Solutio